<title>HUNGARY: ZALAKERAMIA BOOSTS JAN-SEPT PROFITS.</title>
<headline>ZALAKERAMIA BOOSTS JAN-SEPT PROFITS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month period ending Sept</p>
<p>30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					 Jan-Sept 96    Jan-Sept 95</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  788.8    vs    528.7</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		    807.1    vs    562.8</p>
<p>    Net profit			  661.4    vs    507.8</p>
<p>    Gross margin			975.9    vs  1,121.4</p>
<p>    Sales revenue		   2,874.2    vs  2,483.6</p>
<p>    Costs of sales		  1,898.3    vs  1,362.2</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>     administrative costs	   449.4    vs    677.5</p>
<p>    Other operating revenue	 460.6    vs    295.3</p>
<p>    Other operating expense	 198.3    vs    210.4</p>
<p>    Interest revenue		   56.6    vs     62.2</p>
<p>    Interest expenditure	     38.3    vs     28.1</p>
<p>    Taxation			    145.8    vs     55.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Zalakeramia is a tile manufacturer.</p>
<p>The figures are not audited and are calculated according to</p>
<p>International Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
